   "emit_type": "mobile_discover_tx",
   "node": "B",
   "count": 0
  },
  {
   "_c": "... and B never adopts a host",
   "type": "event_count",
   "event_type": "script_emit",
   "emit_type": "mobile_adopted",
   "node": "B",
   "count": 0
  },
  {
   "_c": "team member C: ZERO DISCOVERs (autoregister=false) — even across its re-pick, DAD never triggers a host DISCOVER",
   "type": "event_count",
   "event_type": "script_emit",
   "emit_type": "mobile_discover_tx",
   "node": "C",
   "count": 0
  },
  {
